  m_text: "You are currently positioned on the runway of 25L at KNPA. \n\nWeather
    is 250/12, skys clear, unlimited visibility.  \n\n\n\n\nTake the following steps\r\n\n1.
    Check your flight plan and load any optional points\n\r\n2.Set up your avionics
    and radios to the applicable settings. \n\r\n3. Etc. etc (more to come in the
    scenarios\n\r\n4. Press start when you are ready to begin\r\n"
